-- LandSandBoat: stats for level 99 gear
--
-- Fills in the level 99 equipment LandSandBoat ships with no stats, and corrects level 99
-- pieces whose rows did not match their in-game descriptions. 2291 items in all, across
-- item_mods, item_mods_pet and item_latents. Stats were taken from each item's own
-- description text; pet stats go to item_mods_pet, and earrings that only work in one ear
-- are written as equipped-in-slot latents (latent 40).
-- Not written: set bonuses, Unity Ranking ranges, aftermath, additional effects, and latent
-- conditions LandSandBoat has no handler for.
--
-- Built against LandSandBoat base at d8ace89190 (12 September 2026). Item, mod and latent
-- ids are that build's.
--
-- TO APPLY: back up your database, stop the map server, run this file against your
-- LandSandBoat database (mysql -u USER -p DATABASE < this_file.sql, or paste it into
-- HeidiSQL / DBeaver and run it), then start the server. No rebuild. It only touches the
-- rows listed below and can be run more than once.
--
--   item_mods       19365 added   342 changed   161 removed
--   item_mods_pet     892 added     8 changed     4 removed
--   item_latents      169 added     0 changed     0 removed

-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------
-- item_mods: 19365 rows added, 342 changed, 161 removed
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------

